@startuml dod_contractor_sdlc_roles
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFBFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #334155
skinparam ActivityFontSize 12
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #64748B
skinparam PartitionFontSize 14
skinparam PartitionFontStyle bold
skinparam noteBorderColor #94A3B8
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F1F5F9

title DoD / Program Office ↔ Contractor — SDLC roles\n(mapped toward ReqAML)

|Stakeholder / Mission|
start
:Need / capability gap\n**<color:#64748B>Mission owner, KO, end users</color>**;

|DoD / Government|
:Prioritize & fund\n**<color:#64748B>PM / PE / COR</color>**;
:Author / approve requirements\n& acceptance criteria\n**<color:#64748B>Requirements lead\n(Author + Client admin)</color>**;
:Security control selection\n& overlays (NIST / STIG)\n**<color:#64748B>ISSM / ISSE / SCA\n(Security + Catalog steward)</color>**;

|Contractor delivery|
:Design & implement\nagainst pinned req versions\n**<color:#64748B>Dev lead / engineers\n(Developer)</color>**;
:Build verification evidence\n**<color:#64748B>QA / test\n(Tester)</color>**;
note right
  Change sets nest under
  an SDLC session
  (e.g. 7-day req window)
end note

|DoD / Government cyber|
:Cyber collection & review\ncontrol conformance drift\n**<color:#64748B>ISSM / SCA / AO support\n(Security)</color>**;
if (Acceptable risk?) then (yes)
  :AO / ATO decision path\n**<color:#64748B>Authorizing Official</color>**;
else (gaps)
  :Return findings →\nnew req .N / WI;
  kill
endif

|Release & deploy|
:Release snapshot\n(contracts / delivers)\n**<color:#64748B>Release manager</color>**;
:Deploy to authorized enclave\n**<color:#64748B>Ops / Deployer\n(+ Auditor read-only)</color>**;
stop

legend left
  |= Lane |= Typical org |= Closest ReqAML roles |
  | Stakeholder | Mission / KO | Reader (often) |
  | DoD requirements | PM / COR / reqs | Author, Client admin, Project admin |
  | DoD cyber | ISSM / ISSE / SCA / AO | Security, Catalog steward |
  | Contractor | Prime / sub eng + QA | Developer, Tester, Author (if tasked) |
  | Release / deploy | Gov or contractor ops | Release manager, Auditor |
endlegend

@enduml
